Q3 Postorder traversal (left, right, root)
2, 10, 18, 4, 15, 26, 5, 16, 23, 39


Q4
(a) Valid heap whose preorder is not descending?
Yes. The heap we built is valid, but its preorder is:
39, 26, 18, 2, 10, ...
This is not descending (because 2 comes before 10).

(b) Valid heap whose postorder is not ascending?
Yes. For the same heap, postorder is:
2, 10, 18, 4, 15, ...
This is not ascending (because 18 comes before 4).